{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art-Therapy: Diamonds</strong> is a cozy and meditative game where you create paintings by numbers, placing tiny \u201cdiamonds\u201d on the canvas. It all starts with an empty image, and step by step it comes alive, turning into a finished artwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 What\u2019s inside:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>A large collection of pictures</strong> \u2014 from simple drawings to more detailed artworks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Relaxing music and background sounds</strong> \u2014 choose the mood you like: rain, birdsong, or gentle melodies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Different interface themes</strong> \u2014 adjust the atmosphere to your taste.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd8 <strong>Total relaxation</strong> \u2014 a perfect way to unwind, clear your head, and enjoy a calm activity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game works equally well for short breaks or long evenings when you just want to keep your hands busy with something simple and beautiful.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004500?t=1757609882","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004500?t=1757609882","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004500/f4ec950db9671967c1035219c811be47dcb1fd77/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757609882","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004500/f4ec950db9671967c1035219c811be47dcb1fd77/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757609882","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Pa